"<code>items[?@.name=='emissivity'].value</code>."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Set <strong>On missing</strong> to control what happens when a path can't be "
"resolved: <em>Error</em> stops the run, <em>Null</em> injects null (guard "
"with <code>s.name != null</code> in CEL)."
